| CODE                        | PURPOSE                                 |
+-----------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
| inputValue                  | Controlled input state                  |
| todos                       | Array of todo objects                   |
| handleInputChange           | Updates text input                     |
| handleSubmit                | Validates and adds item                |
| trim()                      | Removes surrounding whitespace         |
| crypto.randomUUID()         | Creates client-side item ID            |
| setTodos(prev => ...)       | Immutable array update                 |
| setInputValue('')           | Clears form                            |
| todos.length                | Number of todos                        |
| todos.map(...)              | Renders list                           |
